			"notes": "DungeonProgressHud 1.0.15 for Minecraft 26.1.2 and Devonian 1.32.9.\n\n## Changes since 1.0.12\n\n- Add current-class and all-class progress bars, separate class targets, and estimated runs to the next level or level 50.\n- Restore saved XP and last-run estimates while profile data loads; retain the last dungeon floor and class between runs.\n- Read completion messages before chat-display mods modify them, fixing the startup hook and handling separately delivered class XP.\n- Add `/dph items add <item> [count] [chestCost]` for manual M7 drops and their net profit.\n- Improve HUD row reordering, scope labels, run-time statistics, and full run-count display.\n- Improve chest purchase and Kismet confirmation, pending-price retries, lifetime totals, and Bazaar/auction pricing.\n- Update the pinned Devonian dependency to 1.32.9 and shorten the README.\n\n## Installation\n\nRequires Minecraft 26.1.2, Java 25, Fabric Loader 0.19.3+, Fabric API, Fabric Language Kotlin, and **Devonian 1.32.9**. Replace the previous DungeonProgressHud JAR with `DungeonProgressHud-1.0.15.jar`.\n\nSkyBlock Profile Viewer 1.8.4+ or SkyBlocker is optional for live Catacombs and class XP. SkyBlockAPI 4.2.19 and its support libraries are bundled; do not add a separate SkyBlockAPI copy.\n\n## Validation\n\nJava 25 Gradle build and all 74 unit tests passed. Live in-game behavior has not been validated for this release."
		},
