			"notes": "Devonian 1.31.9 compatibility update for Minecraft 26.1.2.\n\n- Require Devonian 1.31.9 and update the verified development dependency.\n- Bundle SkyBlockAPI 4.2.19 for Bazaar and auction pricing.\n- Confirm chest purchases and Kismet rerolls from server responses before recording them; keep H-key fake opens explicit.\n- Scope chest, item, Kismet, and run statistics by account/profile and time window while preserving historical profit values.\n- Add safer history writes, backups, recovery commands, and dated log imports.\n- Improve chest reward parsing, HUD layout, and pricing diagnostics.\n- Add the Gradle wrapper and automated build/test workflow.\n\nRequires Minecraft 26.1.2, Java 25, Fabric Loader 0.19.3+, Fabric API, Fabric Language Kotlin, and Devonian 1.31.9. Use SkyBlock Profile Viewer 1.8.4+ or SkyBlocker for live profile data.\n\nSkyBlockAPI is bundled; do not install a second copy alongside this mod.\n\nValidation: Java 25 build succeeded and all 41 unit tests passed. Live in-game inventory/chat confirmation remains unverified."
		},
